   "titulo": {
    "@es": "Los números",
    "@en": "The numbers"
   },
   "texto": [
    {
     "@es": "Del 0 al 12 hay que aprenderlos de memoria. Del 13 al 19 se forman con la unidad + **zehn**: dreizehn, vierzehn, fünfzehn…",
     "@en": "From 0 to 12 you have to learn them by memory. From 13 to 19 they are formed with the unit + **zehn**: dreizehn, vierzehn, fünfzehn"
    },
    {
     "@es": "Dos pierden letras: **sechzehn** (16, sin la s de «sechs») y **siebzehn** (17, sin el «en» de «sieben»).",
     "@en": "Two lose letters: **sechzehn** (16, without «sechs» s) and **siebzehn** (17, without «in» «sieben»)."
    }
   ]
  },
